# Behavior Guide

```
Behavior | Should Be
---------:----------------------------------------------|
Behavior : Damaging Intentions
Should Be: Identified and discouraged. Speak up!
Behavior : Honest Mistakes
Should Be: No ones perfect. Mind constructive feedback.
Behavior : Move Fast & Break
Should Be: Asking consent, respecting when denied.
Behavior : Feels Wrong
Should Be: Don’t do it. Slow down, change your approach.
Behavior : ’Stupid Questions’
Should Be: Impossible. No question is invalid or obvious.
Behavior : ‘Freedom of ______'
Should Be: We define kindness within our environment.
Behavior : Creepy Vibes...
Should Be: Unacceptable. Words and flirts CAN hurt.
Behavior : Users vs Developers
Should Be: Everyone, anywhere. Skill diversification.
```
